Ctrl+L with no collections yet:
  list "Collections", cursor on 0
    All songs  [shown]
    + New collection
  showing None: basics, big-notes, high-od, low-od, rolls-and-swells, stream, sv-and-kiai
Collect from the song menu:
  list "Put the difficulty in", cursor on 0
    + New collection
  showing None: basics, big-notes, high-od, low-od, rolls-and-swells, stream, sv-and-kiai
+ New collection:
  naming "" for New([0])
  showing None: basics, big-notes, high-od, low-od, rolls-and-swells, stream, sv-and-kiai
named and saved:
  Local warm up: basics
  showing None: basics, big-notes, high-od, low-od, rolls-and-swells, stream, sv-and-kiai
  toast: put in warm up, a new collection
a second difficulty put in it with a click:
  Local warm up: basics, big-notes
  showing None: basics, big-notes, high-od, low-od, rolls-and-swells, stream, sv-and-kiai
  toast: put in warm up
put in again: taken out:
  Local warm up: basics
  showing None: basics, big-notes, high-od, low-od, rolls-and-swells, stream, sv-and-kiai
  toast: taken out of warm up
a name taken already:
